From d79bfee4315436629a6e8f66ee0e4b7904b83631 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nectarine <nectarine@localhost>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:47:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] winemac: Hand D3DMetal swapchains to Wine client
 surfaces.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Port CrossOver 22435 with its fixed macdrv_functions and legacy window-data ABI. Enable the Metal layer subclass only for the explicit backend, attach surfaces using Proton’s separate attachment path, and retain queued presentation payloads through teardown. Preserve the normal CAMetalLayer for DXVK/MoltenVK.
